#. *  The content of a <entry/gCal:color> element (‘00FG56’) was not in hexadecimal RGB format.
#: gdata/gdata-parser.c:1193
#, c-format
msgid "The content of a %s element (‘%s’) was not in hexadecimal RGB format."
